1
00:00:01,700 --> 00:00:03,333
Uh...

2
00:00:03,333 --> 00:00:05,267
Welcome, huh?

3
00:00:05,267 --> 00:00:07,100
Wait! Let me do it.

4
00:00:07,100 --> 00:00:08,333
I'll do it.

5
00:00:09,333 --> 00:00:10,567
Wait here, okay?

6
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:15,233
Just sit there and look pretty.

7
00:00:15,233 --> 00:00:18,367
I'll handle it since
you're a guest.

8
00:00:18,367 --> 00:00:19,367
There.

9
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:23,133
Okay...

10
00:00:23,133 --> 00:00:26,200
And now you do this.

11
00:00:26,200 --> 00:00:28,400
Just pour a little into the cap.

12
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:31,200
Then you just throw it away.

13
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:32,500
What the...?

14
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:37,000
That's what you call
an offering to the devil.

15
00:00:37,033 --> 00:00:39,067
Or in English... sorry.

16
00:00:39,067 --> 00:00:42,367
- A sacrifice to the devil.
- [OMINOUS STING]

17
00:00:42,367 --> 00:00:44,433
A sacrifice to who?

18
00:00:44,433 --> 00:00:47,667
Because, sir,
if you don't do that,

19
00:00:47,667 --> 00:00:50,167
the devil might come with you.

20
00:00:50,167 --> 00:00:52,733
Also known as...

21
00:00:52,733 --> 00:00:55,500
- [EVIL LAUGHTER]
- [CHUCKLES]

22
00:00:55,500 --> 00:00:58,167
Okay!

23
00:00:59,767 --> 00:01:02,700
Okay!

24
00:01:02,700 --> 00:01:07,300
[PLAYFUL MUSIC PLAYING]

25
00:01:07,300 --> 00:01:09,067
<i> Geonbae.</i>

26
00:01:09,100 --> 00:01:10,667
Cheers.

27
00:01:10,667 --> 00:01:11,767
Geonbae!

28
00:01:11,767 --> 00:01:13,167
[GLASSES CLINK]

29
00:01:13,167 --> 00:01:17,100
[PLAYFUL MUSIC CONTINUES]

30
00:01:17,100 --> 00:01:19,233
Mmh.

31
00:01:19,233 --> 00:01:20,567
Oh.

32
00:01:20,567 --> 00:01:25,100
Sir, what's the
Korean word for...

33
00:01:26,433 --> 00:01:27,767
...shot glass?

34
00:01:29,333 --> 00:01:31,767
<i>- Jan.
- Oh, here?</i>

35
00:01:31,767 --> 00:01:33,400
<i> Jan.</i>

36
00:01:33,400 --> 00:01:35,233
Oh, jan.

37
00:01:36,300 --> 00:01:37,767
How about...

38
00:01:37,767 --> 00:01:42,400
[PLAYFUL MUSIC CONTINUES]

39
00:01:42,433 --> 00:01:43,767
...bed?

40
00:01:45,500 --> 00:01:47,367
<i> Chimdae.</i>

41
00:01:47,367 --> 00:01:48,500
<i> Chimdae?</i>

42
00:01:50,133 --> 00:01:51,667
How about...

43
00:01:53,433 --> 00:01:54,533
...love?

44
00:01:56,333 --> 00:02:01,233
[ROMANTIC MUSIC PLAYING]

45
00:02:01,233 --> 00:02:02,533
<i> Saranghae.</i>

46
00:02:03,633 --> 00:02:05,233
<i> Saranghae...</i> too.

47
00:02:05,433 --> 00:02:12,167
[ROMANTIC MUSIC CONTINUES]

48
00:02:26,433 --> 00:02:33,333
[ROMANTIC MUSIC CONTINUES]
